mics is a premier digital printing company located in Merrillville, Indiana, specializing in end-to-end Comic Book printing services. Founded in 2024 as a commercial and dedicated comic book printer, we print comic books for select individuals across the country.\\u00a0 We were founded as a result of an attempt of censorship by Ready Comics and Brian Pulido and are a sister company of Divinity Comics Inc.\\u00a0 Our primary goal is to maintain Divinity Comics\' industry presence and help fellow creators find a cheaper more economical solution for their printing needs.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"890ca3b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7b463d6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"What We Do\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"ccaf47d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>That\'s simple, we print comics.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"61ad02a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"column\":\"20\",\"row\":\"20\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#E4E4E4\",\"css_classes\":\"paddingtb\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a315b81\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"25\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5d3e40a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/target.webp\",\"id\":17891,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"title_text\":\"Our Mission\",\"description_text\":\"At Printing Comics, it is our mission to retain standard at all levels from our product and service quality to customer\\u2019s satisfaction. We love and value our customers and aim to deliver our promise; premium comic books printing and unmatched customer\\u2019s service that is almost impossible to find anywhere even outside the industry.\",\"image_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image-box\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"a4a55ac\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"25\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3e64b96\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/vision.webp\",\"id\":17892,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"title_text\":\"Our Vision\",\"description_text\":\"To become a one-stop comic printing shop leveraging years of printing experience and expertise in meticulously delivering every project. We want to be globally recognized as one of a kind digital printing company - exceptional in its printing accuracy and precision.\",\"image_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image-box\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"6920a8d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"25\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5769daa\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/values.webp\",\"id\":17893,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"title_text\":\"Our Values\",\"description_text\":\"Integrity, honesty, great quality, and swift turn around times. These are more than taglines for us: they are the key pillars holding our business right from its formation. We relate with every customer keeping these word