what not to do<\\/li><li>Why a physical proof helps<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"a3e3d1e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"text\":\"DOWNLOAD\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a50cb25\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"50d815c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"File Setup & Submission\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"4bddfba\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"flex_align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7f41b95\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c41b190\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<div data-widget-id=\\\"70e05334-13d8-4534-ba52-f694624b76ad\\\" data-placement-id=\\\"85913fd7-4162-4a0f-af97-8241d6fb086d\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div class=\\\"sd-simple-text-70e05334-13d8-4534-ba52-f694624b76ad \\\"><div id=\\\"sd-simple-text-editable-70e05334-13d8-4534-ba52-f694624b76ad\\\" data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><h3><strong>Start with the correct template.\\u00a0<\\/strong><\\/h3><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div data-widget-id=\\\"d67919c0-c17c-4de7-801b-46c435a6d901\\\" data-placement-id=\\\"0a19fd11-73e3-41e7-a0bb-e44b30d3d21c\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div class=\\\"sd-simple-text-d67919c0-c17c-4de7-801b-46c435a6d901 \\\"><div id=\\\"sd-simple-text-editable-d67919c0-c17c-4de7-801b-46c435a6d901\\\" data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><p>Properly setting up your files from the beginning can significantly speed up production turnaround time. It starts with your illustrator. Creators and publishers often make the mistake of allowing the initial illustrator to not use a template from the printer intended for the final book. This oversight can lead to critical artwork being cut off when the book is printed\\u2014that\\u2019s why you need to always review your proofs! We offer over 20 sizes to choose from, accommodating all creative publishing ventures. Moreover, we provide\\u00a0<strong><a href=\\\"#\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">free PDF templates for every size<\\/a>.<\\/strong> Download the appropriate template, share it with your artists, and streamline your production process.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2907dc3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2b76d2a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/right-size.webp\",\"id\":17755,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"9593a4b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"flex_align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0897e5d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"cf7b020\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<div data-widget-id=\\\"0af2b83f-2ec6-4777-abb0-0d10c7f74be4\\\" data-placement-id=\\\"3f56a2ec-46fa-4354-bd03-46e952f1d7a8\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div class=\\\"sd-simple-text-0af2b83f-2ec6-4777-abb0-0d10c7f74be4 \\\"><div id=\\\"sd-simple-text-editable-0af2b83f-2ec6-4777-abb0-0d10c7f74be4\\\" data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><h3><strong>Size your pages according to your Order. But, dont forget to add bleed.\\u00a0<\\/strong><\\/h3><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div data-widget-id=\\\"7114aabc-ed38-4ae0-9b14-d3902a1aca02\\\" data-placement-id=\\\"dcd8483a-8852-4012-9e30-8bd802087cc6\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div class=\\\"sd-simple-text-7114aabc-ed38-4ae0-9b14-d3902a1aca02 \\\"><div id=\\\"sd-simple-text-editable-7114aabc-ed38-4ae0-9b14-d3902a1aca02\\\" data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><p>If you are not starting by opening a CWS template in your design software, then you must ensure to add 0.25\\\" to both the height and width of your file. Chosen size + 0.25\\\" = File submission size. Correct sizing speeds up the turnaround time.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2268577\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d5a8764\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/mask-group-115038.webp\",\"id\":17757,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f69fec2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"flex_align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"179e2a4\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"430c074\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<div data-widget-id=\\\"0af2b83f-2ec6-4777-abb0-0d10c7f74be4\\\" data-placemen