t-id=\\\"28f3948d-482b-4010-ad88-86a5e15763e1\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div><div data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><p><strong><em>* Follow these rules to receive our Crowdfunding discount.\\u00a0<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div data-widget-id=\\\"08787cb2-457f-414c-8687-88a3c1bbebe4\\\" data-placement-id=\\\"c5b812f4-328b-4707-b9eb-d61e166265e3\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div><div data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><h4><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Discount will NOT be applied AFTER the campaign.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h4><p>To be eligible for this program, you must be in contact with us prior to launching your crowdfunding campaign.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div data-widget-id=\\\"abb95cac-b2cc-441e-b052-8ac73250a464\\\" data-placement-id=\\\"d7d7eb99-6cde-4a1f-a09f-68a811a9cd42\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div><div data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><h4><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>You will receive one discount code for your print order.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h4><p>Whether you run campaigns on multiple platforms or just one campaign, your one discount code applies to your print order. It cannot be combined with other discount codes.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div data-widget-id=\\\"ab0b21dc-1772-495a-b166-18375d63c612\\\" data-placement-id=\\\"0d7cc33e-9b2c-4cae-b3d9-71560dc8e502\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div><div data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><h4><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Discount code expires in 60 days or less.\\u00a0<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h4><p><span style=\\\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-size ); font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight );\\\">Get started below.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"f080bbb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"text\":\"Divider\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"e7771be\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/images.png\",\"id\":18093,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"118a408\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/step1-resized200x209.png\",\"id\":18074,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"78d3faf\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<h2><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Before you launch:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h2><p><strong>Download the image below<\\/strong> and place it on your crowdfunding campaign page.<\\/p><p>This graphic must be visible to qualify you for the discount program.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"a0514e6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/10-off-coupon-printing-comics.jpg\",\"id\":18085,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"caption\":\"Note: The coupon can be used only once per order and cannot be combined with other discount codes.\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"f9d1aa2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"text\":\"DOWNLOAD IMAGE\",\"align\":\"center\",\"link\":{\"ur