s\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>Creators enjoy creating but fulfillment might not be so enjoyable. We come from an extensive background of shipping comics to be able to help with your fulfillment needs.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"9d218d3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<h3><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Multiple shipping addresses? No problem<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p>We\'ll take care of splitting up the print order for you and packaging up where it needs to go. Coming straight from the printer is a good option for faster fulfillment services which spend less time in transit.<\\/p><h4><strong>Follow these steps to take advantage of this option.<\\/strong><\\/h4>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"d348641\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/step1-resized200x209.png\",\"id\":18074,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"65236f7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>When you place your online print order, specify in the Notes section that you\'re interested in our fulfillment services. We will begin the printing process and send you our Fulfillment Spreadsheet for you to begin filling out your shipping information.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"7dede82\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/step2-resized200x209.png\",\"id\":18075,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"eeb1451\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>Before we start the shipping process, you\'ll have to finish submitting your shipping information to us and we will provide you with a shipping quote.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"58fbaf0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/step3-resized200x209.png\",\"id\":18076,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"8d612cf\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>Once you\'ve had a chance to look over the quote, we\'ll send you a shipping invoice along with a confirmation of all of the shipping addresses. When you pay the invoice, we will move forward to shipping. The rest is on us so you can stay focused on creating!<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"71357c9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"text\":\"ORDER MY COMICS\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"\\/shop\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"},{\"id\":\"deac1c8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(11170,17891,'_wp_attached_file','2024/08/target.webp'),(11171,17891,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:59;s:6:\"height\";i:59;s:4:\"file\";s:19:\"2024/08/target.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:1576;s:5:\"sizes\";a:0:{}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"