b84302936',1725665096),(40715,57,'_weight',0.226796),(48428,57,'_regular_price',3.55),(48429,57,'_price',3.55),(48430,19647,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(48431,19647,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(48432,19647,'_elementor_version','3.23.4'),(48433,19647,'_wp_page_template','default'),(48434,19647,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"bf4530a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"column\":\"40\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"css_classes\":\"paddingtb\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e9b4168\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"465d69e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"Who We Are\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"37fea26\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>Printing Comics is a premier digital &amp; offset printing company located in Plymouth, Michigan, specializing in end-to-end Comic Book printing services. Founded in 2011 as a commercial and dedicated comic book printer, we print comic books for several individuals across the country and all over the world. Our primary goal is to delight our comic book publishers with the best printing experience accompanied by excellent and exceptional customer service.<\\/p><p>Since our inception in the printing industry, we have evolved into a leading printer, printing comic books for over 7000 customers across the globe. Over the years we\\u2019ve remained privately-owned and operated by Anthony Grech; a renowned and passionate entrepreneur who\\u2019s ever committed to helping self-publishers make their dreams of having a top-notch and high-quality\\u00a0<strong>self publish comic book<\\/strong>\\u00a0in their hand a reality.<\\/p><p>Going by our passion for continuously bringing top-of-the-services to ensure that publishers find the best quality work that suits their needs, Anthony launched the company which has today become the heart of the printing industry offering its unique quality and unparalleled customer service at humanly affordable pricing. We take pride in our ability to meet all your\\u00a0<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.grekoprinting-comixwellspring.com\\/standard-manga-and-magazine-sized-comics\\/\\\"><strong>custom comic book<\\/strong><\\/a>\\u00a0printing needs and completing your project correctly and on time under one roof!<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"890ca3b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7b463d6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"What We Do\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"ccaf47d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>At Printing Comics, our specialty is comic book printing where we offer our broad spectrum of services ranging from Saddle Stitched Comic books, Square bound paperback books (Perfect Binding), Posters, Flyers, Retractable Banner Stands, Table Cloths, Vinyl Banners &amp; much more.<\\/p><p>Whether you\\u2019re a self-publisher,\\u00a0<strong>graphic novel creator<\\/strong>, Artist, or running a comic con, we are in business to deliver best in class printing using high-tech and state-of-the-art equipment in facilitating the most appealing designs and quality products carefully monitored with attention to detail.<\\/p><p>We believe that quality work begins from understanding our customer\\u2019s need while tailoring our services to produce the result they envisioned. From the professional staff under our roof to our expert printing approaches, you will understand why top comic artists choose us and rate Comix Well Spring very high in the industry.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"61ad02a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"column\":\"20\",\"row\":\"20\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#E4E4E4\",\"css_classes\":\"paddingtb\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a315b81\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"25\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5d3e40a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/target.webp\",\"id\":17891,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"title_text\":\"Our Mission\",\"description_text\":\"At Printing Comics, it is our mission to retain standard at all levels from our product and service quality to customer\\u2019s satisfaction. We love and value our customers and aim to deliver our promise; premium comic books printing and unmatched customer\\u2019s service that is almost impossible to find anywhere even outside the industry.\",\"image_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image-box\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"a4a55ac\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"25\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3e64b96\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/printingcomics.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/vision.webp\",\"id\":17892,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"title_text\":\"Our Vision\",\"description_text\":\"To become a one-stop comic printing shop leveraging years of printing experience and expertise in meticulously delivering every project. We want to be globally recognized as one of a kind digital printing company - excepti