:\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"12a2721\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<div data-widget-id=\\\"dfb53682-c8b9-410f-b78a-7ff4824003fa\\\" data-placement-id=\\\"28f3948d-482b-4010-ad88-86a5e15763e1\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div class=\\\"sd-simple-text-dfb53682-c8b9-410f-b78a-7ff4824003fa \\\"><div id=\\\"sd-simple-text-editable-dfb53682-c8b9-410f-b78a-7ff4824003fa\\\" data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><p><strong><em>* To receive the discount code, you must follow these ground rules. NO exceptions.\\u00a0<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div data-widget-id=\\\"08787cb2-457f-414c-8687-88a3c1bbebe4\\\" data-placement-id=\\\"c5b812f4-328b-4707-b9eb-d61e166265e3\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div class=\\\"sd-simple-text-08787cb2-457f-414c-8687-88a3c1bbebe4 \\\"><div id=\\\"sd-simple-text-editable-08787cb2-457f-414c-8687-88a3c1bbebe4\\\" data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><h4><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>No post-campaign discounts.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h4><p>\\u00a0If your crowdfunding campaign has already been launched or fully funded before you connect with us, you are not eligible for this program. You must submit your initial request (a link to your unpublished campaign containing the provided image below) BEFORE you launch your crowdfunding campaign.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div data-widget-id=\\\"abb95cac-b2cc-441e-b052-8ac73250a464\\\" data-placement-id=\\\"d7d7eb99-6cde-4a1f-a09f-68a811a9cd42\\\" data-placement-status=\\\"ACTIVE\\\"><div class=\\\"sd-simple-text-abb95cac-b2cc-441e-b052-8ac73250a464 \\\"><div id=\\\"sd-simple-text-editable-abb95cac-b2cc-441e-b052-8ac73250a464\\\" data-edit-mode=\\\"\\\"><h4><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>One discount code is good for one print order.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h4><p>Regardless of how many crowdfunding platforms you use to crowdfund your 